          "explanation": "Untrusted request parameter data is processed through `thing.doSomething(param)` before concatenation into the SQL statement. Because the concrete implementation of `ThingInterface` instantiated by `ThingFactory.createThing()` is omitted from the evidence, it is uncertain whether sanitization or transformation occurs.",
          "outcome": "genuine_human_review",
          "reasons": [],
          "verdict": "human_review"
        },
        {
          "case_id": "BenchmarkTest01752",
          "expected": "false_positive",
          "explanation": "Untrusted request data is assigned to 'param' via SeparateClassRequest.getTheValue and passed into Test.doSomething, where it is placed into a HashMap and returned unchanged. The returned value is concatenated into 'fileName' without validation or sanitization, reaching the constructor of FileInputStream.",
          "outcome": "fp_retained",
          "reasons": [],
          "verdict": "true_positive"
        },
        {
          "case_id": "BenchmarkTest01794",
          "expected": "false_positive",
          "explanation": "Untrusted user input retrieved from SeparateClassRequest flows through Test.doSomething, where the arithmetic branch condition ((500 / 42) + 196 = 207 > 200) always evaluates to true, assigning the raw parameter to bar. This unvalidated input is concatenated into command arguments passed to Runtime.exec, enabling command injection.",
          "outcome": "fp_retained",
          "reasons": [],
          "verdict": "true_positive"
        },
        {
          "case_id": "BenchmarkTest02429",
          "expected": "true_positive",
          "explanation": "Untrusted input from the HTTP request is processed by thing.doSomething(param) before being placed into command arguments executed via Runtime.getRuntime().exec. Because the implementation of ThingInterface loaded at runtime is not present in the provided source files, it cannot be verified whether the input is effectively sanitized or safely handled.",
          "outcome": "genuine_human_review",
          "reasons": [],
          "verdict": "human_review"
        },
        {
          "case_id": "BenchmarkTest02517",
          "expected": "true_positive",
          "explanation": "Untrusted input from request.getParameterValues is passed through doSomething() via a dynamically loaded ThingInterface implementation. Because the implementation code for ThingInterface (and thing.properties) is omitted from the evidence, it is impossible to verify whether the input is sanitized or altered before being passed into Runtime.exec.",
          "outcome": "genuine_human_review",
          "reasons": [],
          "verdict": "human_review"
        },
        {
